// Prophecy topics: what he tends to foresee. The oracle gene weights each
// topic, so one seer is all pellets and another all doom. A prophecy row in
// thoughts.def names its topic; a plain thought has none.
// Stable ids: never renumber, never reuse.
// BLORB_TOPIC(id, name)
BLORB_TOPIC(0, food)
BLORB_TOPIC(1, danger)
BLORB_TOPIC(2, sky)
BLORB_TOPIC(3, owner)
BLORB_TOPIC(4, doom)
BLORB_TOPIC(5, luck)
BLORB_TOPIC(6, pond)
